#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/
/android/build/

# Planning documents stay local-only: they change too often to belong in a
# public repository, and the shipped-work record lives in the changelog.
docs/ROADMAP.md

# Generated sources stay out of version control: they are deterministic
# (build_runner + gen-l10n reproduce them byte-for-byte) and committing them
# caused repeated "forgot to regenerate" failures. Build after cloning:
#   flutter pub get && flutter gen-l10n && dart run build_runner build
lib/**/*.g.dart
lib/**/*.freezed.dart
lib/core/l10n/
